HST Office: helpers for file writes that survive a power cut.

- comphelper hstdurablefile.{hxx,cxx}: syncFile (fsync / FlushFileBuffers), syncParentDirectory (fsync of
  the folder after a rename or unlink; no-op on Windows) and writeFileAtomically (temporary file in the same
  folder, write, fsync, rename over the file, fsync of the folder). Used by configmgr, framework (recovery
  index, tab layout, unsaved documents) and sfx2 (saving over an existing file).

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/unit/test_recovery_durability_patches.py.
---
--- a/comphelper/Library_comphelper.mk
+++ b/comphelper/Library_comphelper.mk
@@ -94,6 +94,7 @@ $(eval $(call gb_Library_add_exception_objects,comphelper,\
     comphelper/source/misc/asyncquithandler \
     comphelper/source/misc/automationinvokedzone \
     comphelper/source/misc/backupfilehelper \
